 "note": "Lancer GTi saloon (notchback), as raced in rounds 1-5 and shown by the BBC graphics all season. Measured on Super Touring Register 4705 (Hales #88, right side, near side-on, mirrored to our left side and levelled): stripes, ESSO board, diamonds, Firestone, name. Left side checked on Getty LAT 2201201287 and 2201201308 (Snetterton, front-left 3/4): same layout, Hales on the rear door window. Wheels: black 5-spoke, from 4705 and the Snetterton photos (on track only, no standing photo). Uncertain: the boot and tail lie outside 4705 and follow the BBC drawing; the left-side lettering is assumed to mirror the right side; Mark above Hales is small and blurred."
